    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-oldenborn-furrykin=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"You can make a lie feel tired.\"</em></p><p><strong>Moonlit Ward (tier uses / Soma Break).</strong> Reaction — when you or an ally within 6 squares would be Charmed or Shaken, grant them reroll-lowest on the defense check. On a success, the aggressor rolls 3d10 keep lowest 2 on their next attack.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"oldLumenMoonlitWard\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Moonlit Ward</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> tier uses / Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Reaction (within 6 squares) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Grant reroll-lowest on defense vs Charmed/Shaken to you or ally; success makes aggressor roll 3d10kl2 next attack.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
